35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The minutes show no review of the current setup in five years.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The sticker register shows most flats have one bike, but some have three.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Watching the entrance, four out of eleven departures required shifting bikes.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The ledger is empty of capital funds. The ward park costs 2,600 yen.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer spends three hours a month on current collections.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, did you check the neighbouring block? I heard they had issues.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,The rain exposure is bad past the downpipe. Saddles stay wet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The display frame takes twenty seconds to load. It’s not easy.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we charge, it’s a levy. The ward park has a waitlist.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"Yes, the neighbourly block had arrears. Two stopped attending meetings.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The complaint log has nine entries, all ignored. We need a clear owner.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"If we pay, people might accept it. The register says they’d rather pay.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The physical effort of shared racks might be too high for daily use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"2,600 yen is high. But our account is flat.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,Adding billing to the treasurer’s load is risky. It already takes three hours.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
